---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact & Support"
  description="Get in touch with the ImageTool team for feedback, bug reports, feature requests, and open source contributions."
  path="/contact"
>
  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-10 text-slate-300">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 text-xs font-semibold uppercase">
        Get In Touch
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-100 tracking-tight">
        Contact &amp; Community Support
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base leading-relaxed">
        Have questions, feedback, or a feature suggestion? We welcome community participation and issues on GitHub.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      {/* GitHub Issues & Bug Reports */}
      <div class="p-6 bg-slate-900/60 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-700/60 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100">
          GitHub Issues &amp; Bug Reports
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Encountered a bug, model compatibility issue, or browser error? Open an issue on our public issue tracker with your browser version and hardware specs.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/NajeebKalwar/ImageTool/issues"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 underline"
        >
          Open a GitHub Issue &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

      {/* Feature Suggestions & Discussion */}
      <div class="p-6 bg-slate-900/60 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-700/60 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100">
          Discussions &amp; Feature Requests
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Want to see a new image editing feature, additional AI model architecture, or batch optimization format? Share your ideas in GitHub Discussions.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/NajeebKalwar/ImageTool/discussions"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline"
        >
          Join GitHub Discussions &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Privacy Inquiries */}
    <section class="p-6 bg-slate-950/60 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-100">
        Privacy &amp; Security Audits
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
        ImageTool is an open-source project. If you are a security researcher or developer reviewing our P-01 to P-04 privacy architecture, we welcome independent code reviews and pull requests on GitHub.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
